  <metadata>
    <name>The Shippey 20-mile loop</name>
    <desc>Track coordinates copy the 11,945-point "Shippey 20 mile loop" line from the organizer's Google My Maps (mid=1PYJm-QOer7LvmGH4y4iRRRyYvocHGCI), exported 2026-08-13 and linked from the runner information page. The line is drawn in the clockwise direction the race runs in odd years, including 2027; even years run it reversed. The 100-mile race runs 5 laps. Station waypoints are the organizer's Start/Finish Aid Station and Sverdrup Lodge markers.</desc>
    <link href="https://theshippey.com/runner-info/"><text>The Shippey runner information page</text></link>
  </metadata>
